{
  "name": "Instagram Competitor Followers & Following Lead Scraper (No Login Required)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Instagram Competitor Followers & Following Lead Scraper (No Login Required)\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nExtract public follower and following profiles from niche Instagram accounts without risking an Instagram session cookie.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/instagram-followers-following-no-login-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/instagram-followers-following-no-login-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Instagram Followers & Following (No Login)** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "75c350d4-abac-40f7-a190-cbcc189adbed",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Instagram Followers & Following (No Login)** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "9ce2e04e-7c23-438f-aacc-1401090cceb6",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "58d98ed0-46ff-4671-ad9e-6c34725a1430",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
